### 1. 회원 등록
POST http://localhost/member/join
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "admin",
  "pw": "admin@pass",
  "name": "제작자",
  "phone": "010-1234-1234"
}

### 2. 회원 목록
GET http://localhost/member/list

### 3. 회원 상세보기
GET http://localhost/member/get/admin

### 4. 회원 수정
PUT http://localhost/member/update/admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "수정된 이름",
  "phone": "010-9876-9876"
}

### 5. 회원 삭제
DELETE http://localhost/member/delete/admin